{
    "word": "vaporous",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                "word": "vaporous",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8a3fe8fc-f372-412c-b1d7-9108b9592d23",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more vaporous"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f58bab24-5576-40b9-9202-86e8993d1932",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most vaporous"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2fca1be6-061d-3c5e-b569-e51c0aad5d86",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or relating to vapour; also, having the characteristics or consistency of vapour."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aeb07c8a-8c26-43c7-bcdb-f071211a5124",
                                "sense_id": "2fca1be6-061d-3c5e-b569-e51c0aad5d86",
                                "text": "Hovv can darkneſſe be called a Maſſe? &c. No it cannot. Nor a thin vaporous matter neither."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb1da0f8-871a-491d-a5e4-256b11f1327c",
                                "sense_id": "2fca1be6-061d-3c5e-b569-e51c0aad5d86",
                                "text": "For the great rock has screened the westering sun / That still on plains beyond streams vaporous gold / Among the branches; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf72d1dc-0710-4036-9654-5d8c8cc6c5b4",
                                "sense_id": "2fca1be6-061d-3c5e-b569-e51c0aad5d86",
                                "text": "The wind began to rise and soon the vapourous mist began to eddy and whirl in wild confusion."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6c26d1d-056b-3b2a-9ad1-9c3e78294252",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Breathing out or giving off vapour."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a4a3375-42da-3a80-a166-64c3dc0bf6d2",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of a place: filled with vapour; foggy, misty."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1bfc735-03d1-4d2e-9896-f53ee398b26d",
                                "sense_id": "5a4a3375-42da-3a80-a166-64c3dc0bf6d2",
                                "text": "O hatefull, vaporous, and foggy night, / Since thou art guilty of my cureleſſe crime: / Muſter thy miſts to meete the Eaſterne light, / Make vvar againſt proportion'd courſe of time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "226f6621-aaa9-4ce9-a7a3-087cf3932eb6",
                                "sense_id": "5a4a3375-42da-3a80-a166-64c3dc0bf6d2",
                                "text": "[W]e ſee that the very aire it ſelfe is never conglaciate nor frozen, nor hardened, conſidering that miſts, fogs and clouds are no congealations, but onely gatherings and thickenings of a moiſt and vapourous aire: for the true aire indeed vvhich hath no vapour at all and is altogether drie, admitteth no ſuch refrigeration as may alter it to that degree and heigth ^([sic])."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82d52568-809c-4b5d-ba43-1520b975de96",
                                "sense_id": "5a4a3375-42da-3a80-a166-64c3dc0bf6d2",
                                "text": "Beneath is spread like a green sea / The waveless plain of Lombardy, / Bounded by the vaporous air, / Islanded by cities fair; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fff4adb-c65c-4b90-8d45-ef7733c60d79",
                                "sense_id": "5a4a3375-42da-3a80-a166-64c3dc0bf6d2",
                                "text": "[I]t applied itself lustily to the pipe and sent forth such abundant volleys of tobacco smoke that the small cottage kitchen became all vaporous."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a816713f-b458-3bc7-a249-502adc80b697",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of a thing: covered or hidden by vapour, fog, or mist."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb85daea-2f52-4581-a109-43a6391f5ff6",
                                "sense_id": "a816713f-b458-3bc7-a249-502adc80b697",
                                "text": "Wide sea, that one continuous murmur breeds / Along the pebbled shore of memory! / Many old rotten-timber'd boats there be / Upon thy vaporous bosom, magnified / To goodly vessels; many a sail of pride, / And golden keel'd, is left unlaunch'd and dry."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a135cb16-8d0e-3ffb-b1d0-de647d060e74",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lacking depth or substance; insubstantial, thoughtless, vague."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2286a018-71d1-481c-89c1-8e385052646b",
                                "sense_id": "a135cb16-8d0e-3ffb-b1d0-de647d060e74",
                                "text": "So vvhoſoeuer ſhall entertaine high and vapourous imaginations, in ſteede of a laborious and ſober inquiry of truth ſhall beget hopes and Beliefes of ſtrange and impoſſible ſhapes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba8868fd-a853-430c-a1c0-5336506cebb9",
                                "sense_id": "a135cb16-8d0e-3ffb-b1d0-de647d060e74",
                                "text": "Now I recenter my immortal mind / In the deep sabbath of meek self-content; / Cleans'd from the vaporous passions that bedim / God's Image, sister of the Seraphim."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f09b5d1e-8043-45ad-8d92-0909d326cec1",
                                "sense_id": "a135cb16-8d0e-3ffb-b1d0-de647d060e74",
                                "text": "The boundless, overflowing, bursting gladness, / The vapourous exultation not to be confined!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f344448-c1e4-4723-b865-843f7ede1daa",
                                "sense_id": "a135cb16-8d0e-3ffb-b1d0-de647d060e74",
                                "text": "B****, the mouth-piece of the debating clubs, noisy, vaporous, and democratic; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25aeba72-b70e-4f53-a7fc-fd3f8c3583fb",
                                "sense_id": "a135cb16-8d0e-3ffb-b1d0-de647d060e74",
                                "text": "How! have I slept? Shame on my vaporous brain!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a81af408-fdef-4281-a94a-897adaa9f7b7",
                                "sense_id": "a135cb16-8d0e-3ffb-b1d0-de647d060e74",
                                "text": "[I]t was momentarily within his imagination that the provision for him might come in some way from his mother. But such vaporous conjecture passed away as quickly as it came."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "92a28576-860d-32ca-b57e-850103d8344f",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of clothes or fabric: thin and translucent; filmy, gauzy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fc4d112-cfe5-4159-85f4-31526a4745a8",
                                "sense_id": "92a28576-860d-32ca-b57e-850103d8344f",
                                "text": "[A]irily-attired ladies were lounging upon the chairs in the gardens of the Tuileries; only the most fragile and vaporous bonnets were to be seen in the Bois de Boulogne; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ec27e10-1472-41db-bc85-b57a7899e0cf",
                                "sense_id": "92a28576-860d-32ca-b57e-850103d8344f",
                                "text": "She carried herself no less attentively than usual, and kept no less anxious an eye upon her vaporous skirts; she held her bouquet very tight, and counted over the flowers for the twentieth time."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4fdb69e4-e73a-3b09-8156-812a6bab0a16",
                        "entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Feeling melancholy; experiencing the vapors."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a339dc5-b626-4cca-a04c-e25cf2d4ca97",
                                "sense_id": "4fdb69e4-e73a-3b09-8156-812a6bab0a16",
                                "text": "The task at first daunted him, and he wailed to Mary that he could not write about the Florentines because he no longer enjoyed them as a school. Again Mary rescued him from his vaporous mood, and the two of them vigorously plunged into the new work."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28bb49d9-4460-4feb-bc5e-9c796643bbcf",
                        "source_entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or relating to vapour; having the characteristics or consistency of vapour",
                        "target_lang_word": "vaporeux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vaporeux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12e58855-0ea1-3092-9a1e-06132f89e26b",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2f5c87-5f97-3683-a110-ff6eebd7c010",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui contient ou semble contenir de la vapeur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d82c20d8-7b4e-4c84-aa65-07fbbfe2247c",
                                                "sense_id": "12e58855-0ea1-3092-9a1e-06132f89e26b",
                                                "text": "Elle n’était plus qu’une vision vaporeuse, inconsistante, qui allait se dissiper dans la clarté lunaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1abf6e9c-bfb7-4008-8e38-32627bf12ce4",
                                                "sense_id": "12e58855-0ea1-3092-9a1e-06132f89e26b",
                                                "text": "Le soleil poudroyait sur les bois, les mouches vrombissaient à travers ses rais vaporeux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d844116-9ef7-418a-979e-5e410c48b24d",
                                                "sense_id": "12e58855-0ea1-3092-9a1e-06132f89e26b",
                                                "text": "Là, sur le dernier plan, les vaporeuses collines de Belleville, chargées de maisons et de moulins, confondent leurs accidents avec ceux des nuages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "408d3a08-4853-440b-8f59-6efd8bac0b13",
                                                "sense_id": "12e58855-0ea1-3092-9a1e-06132f89e26b",
                                                "text": "Comme Mattia n’avait jamais vu la mer, notre première promenade fut pour la jetée : pendant quelques minutes il resta les yeux perdus dans les profondeurs vaporeuses de l’horizon, puis, faisant claquer sa langue, il déclara que c’était laid, triste et sale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f31bef3-4184-3091-a37f-c7b9bdd2af0d",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2f5c87-5f97-3683-a110-ff6eebd7c010",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui semble baigné de vapeur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plus rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e3b6412-3d45-4270-9e3f-c906df5bc131",
                                                "sense_id": "6f31bef3-4184-3091-a37f-c7b9bdd2af0d",
                                                "text": "En des reculs de brume s’ébauchait le cône vaporeux des sapins ; […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e58764b-eaec-3458-9c42-a8845e990bd1",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2f5c87-5f97-3683-a110-ff6eebd7c010",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui imite cette vapeur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Peinture"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5698303b-3dd9-4283-a41f-fa91e67706ca",
                                                "sense_id": "7e58764b-eaec-3458-9c42-a8845e990bd1",
                                                "text": "Il a une manière vaporeuse de peindre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b614d3a8-2948-4c99-998d-a989f7109a3e",
                                                "sense_id": "7e58764b-eaec-3458-9c42-a8845e990bd1",
                                                "text": "Il fait souvent des tableaux vaporeux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "675180fa-9418-3e73-b40e-89ab29908625",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2f5c87-5f97-3683-a110-ff6eebd7c010",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fin, léger, transparent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c36b3647-5d4d-4e93-8117-cdf6268c7830",
                                                "sense_id": "675180fa-9418-3e73-b40e-89ab29908625",
                                                "text": "Avec des rires, des cris joyeux, on posa sur la tête brune de la catherinette l’édifice vaporeux et charmant qui lui donnait une grâce nouvelle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97b2a25e-1845-3aad-b730-24cb9afc2f28",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2f5c87-5f97-3683-a110-ff6eebd7c010",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Confus comme dans un état second."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6909e3c8-f7dd-49cb-a2ef-2c9a33e9ab16",
                                                "sense_id": "97b2a25e-1845-3aad-b730-24cb9afc2f28",
                                                "text": "Mieux même, cet état vaporeux, plutôt que de me brûler aurait tendance à me dévoiler, telle une plaque photographique sensible à l’action de la lumière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab1f1235-f536-33ed-baa8-322ec210483a",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2f5c87-5f97-3683-a110-ff6eebd7c010",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui parait impalpable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ae596dc-6363-4680-a574-86f36bc0d27a",
                                                "sense_id": "ab1f1235-f536-33ed-baa8-322ec210483a",
                                                "text": "Femmes fragiles et vaporeuses, fées aux mains douces, petits souffles de la maison qui font naître silencieusement l’ordre et la beauté, femmes sans voix, soumises, j’ai beau chercher, je n’en vois pas beaucoup dans le paysage de mon enfance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcca6920-4889-3069-ae2c-39df58e6ed54",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2f5c87-5f97-3683-a110-ff6eebd7c010",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n’a pas de définition précise, qui est considéré comme flou."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81c6fe50-399c-4508-8cd9-3b08a8d39a88",
                                                "sense_id": "dcca6920-4889-3069-ae2c-39df58e6ed54",
                                                "text": "Les services publics sont soumis en France au principe de légalité, et à lui seul. Non à ce concept vaporeux de « valeurs républicaines », d’autant plus récupérable qu’il n’est défini nulle part."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d66ea2eb-18f1-4c2e-9b41-d66dc8ab8996",
                        "source_entry_id": "b83c96d6-2d28-38e6-a03f-10835c7e1ec9",
